{"id":"4dad079dff660754","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-zfc-hartogs-number.md","title":"ZFC Hartogs Number","display":"df-zfc-hartogs-number — ZFC Hartogs Number","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-hartogs-number","aliases":["58-df-zfc-hartogs-number"],"display":"df-zfc-hartogs-number — ZFC Hartogs Number","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-injection.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-hartogs-number"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-hartogs-number</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-hartogs-number — ZFC Hartogs Number"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f5a60b2c6e668b3e\" href=\"?note=f5a60b2c6e668b3e\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-injection.md\">../batch11/58-df-injection.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h,X,\\alpha,f,g\\in V\">\\(h,X,\\alpha,f,g\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Injection}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Injection}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f5a60b2c6e668b3e\" href=\"?note=f5a60b2c6e668b3e\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-injection.md\">../batch11/58-df-injection.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HartogsNumber}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{HartogsNumber}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}hartogs\\text{-}number} \\vdash \\mathrm{HartogsNumber}_S(h,X) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ordinal}(h)\\land \\neg\\exists f\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Injection}_S(f,h,X)\\land \\forall\\alpha\\in h\\;\\exists g\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Injection}_S(g,\\alpha,X)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}hartogs\\text{-}number} \\vdash \\mathrm{HartogsNumber}_S(h,X) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ordinal}(h)\\land \\neg\\exists f\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Injection}_S(f,h,X)\\land \\forall\\alpha\\in h\\;\\exists g\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Injection}_S(g,\\alpha,X)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Thus <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span> is exactly the least ordinal that does not inject into <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-injection.md","status":"resolved"